B.a_g=s(["**8+ years of mobile development experience** across fintech, healthcare, education, e-commerce, enterprise, and social platforms.","Built and maintained **production mobile applications serving 1M+ users** across Android and iOS.","Developed **multi-application ecosystems** connecting customers, service providers, businesses, drivers, doctors, pharmacies, and other operational roles.","Led and contributed to **Flutter adoption and migration of existing Android applications**, including production healthcare applications.","Implemented complex **financial and payment workflows**, including payment gateways, wallet functionality, earned-wage access, and PCI-compliant payment flows.","Built mobile experiences requiring **background location tracking, real-time communication, video conferencing, push notifications, maps, and deep linking**.","Worked across both **Flutter and native Android**, enabling integration with platform-specific capabilities and existing native applications.","Contributed to **application architecture, modularization, testing, CI/CD, production reliability, and long-term maintainability**.","Worked across the **full mobile application lifecycle**, from feature development and API integration to testing, release, monitoring, and production support.","**Mentored junior developers** and contributed to technical decisions, code quality, and development practices."],t.s)
